WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.923
Lucas Moreira: Hi Paula. Ana is joining us today because I'm on holiday next week and she'll cover for me.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.923
Paula Reis: Hi Lucas, hi Ana. Welcome.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.308
Ana Ribeiro: Hi Paula, nice to meet you.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.154
Lucas Moreira: Today we'll walk through how your forty distributors would log orders and visits in the CRM.

5
00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:08.538
Paula Reis: The main thing for us is one view per distributor: orders, visits, and the promotions they're running.

6
00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:42.769
Paula Reis: This looks good. I'd like my regional managers to see it before we go further.

7
00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:59.385
Lucas Moreira: Of course. I'll set up a session with your regional managers when I'm back.

8
00:26:22.000 --> 00:26:24.308
Paula Reis: Thanks, both. Enjoy your holiday, Lucas.
